WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.350
- [Kelly] Do you do anything outdoorsy?

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.220
- No, come on, no.

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:04.057
- [Kelly] No?
- Yes, you did the triathlon!

00:00:04.057 --> 00:00:05.265
- Yeah, I go out-

00:00:05.265 --> 00:00:06.352
- That's outdoors!

00:00:06.352 --> 00:00:07.410
- And you swim in the ocean.
- [Max] I go outside.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:08.580
- Wait, what in the world?

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:09.413
That was a lie.

00:00:09.413 --> 00:00:10.246
Your answer was a lie.

00:00:10.246 --> 00:00:11.250
- I go outside.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.317
- [Kelly] Okay, yeah, you're outdoorsy.

00:00:13.317 --> 00:00:15.704
- (laughs) Yeah, if that's
what that means, sure.

00:00:15.704 --> 00:00:16.537
(audience laughs)

00:00:16.537 --> 00:00:18.180
- I- That's super outdoorsy.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.310
You being outdoors in an extended amount

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:21.690
of period to conquer that.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.490
- And you almost drowned.
- [Max] It was a couple hours.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.630
- You almost drowned?

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:25.463
- Yes. (chuckles)

00:00:25.463 --> 00:00:27.330
- Um, I did almost drown.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:28.163
There was- (laughs)

00:00:28.163 --> 00:00:28.996
- What?

00:00:28.996 --> 00:00:29.882
- [Max] We were-

00:00:29.882 --> 00:00:30.715
- Don't you have to sign something?

00:00:30.715 --> 00:00:31.950
I have to sign things with production

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.299
that you're not allowed to die.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:34.132
- [Beth] Yes!

00:00:34.132 --> 00:00:35.446
I just, I ignore it.

00:00:35.446 --> 00:00:36.810
I tell them that I'm
just gonna go for a walk.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:40.200
Um, I told this, I- there was a woman

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.710
who I did the triathlon
with the year before,

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
and she was like, "I'm really
worried about the swim in."

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.420
And I said, "Oh, I go,
Don't worry about this."

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:49.500
And she goes, "Yeah, I'm worried about

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.180
a wave coming over,
hitting me in the head."

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:54.428
And I go, "Honey, That
is never gonna happen."

00:00:54.428 --> 00:00:55.410
(laughs)

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:57.360
- I start swimming in,
which is like, you know

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.210
it's towards the end and
you know how you gi- going

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:02.370
feels like I'm not really moving anywhere.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:04.950
And the next thing you know,
just as I had that thought

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:08.249
a wave came over and smashed
me so hard in the head.

00:01:08.249 --> 00:01:11.396
Goggles go off, my body
is going everywhere.

00:01:11.396 --> 00:01:16.396
And I think to myself,
"Huh, this is how I die."

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.660
- I have had this moment
with a big, huge we-

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:21.150
they, the waves kept coming in
and in Hawaii and I was like

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:23.550
they're not- the universe is
not taking this day from me.

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:24.383
I had like one day.

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:25.560
- I got really calm. Did you get calm?

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.256
- [Kelly] I got so calm!

00:01:27.256 --> 00:01:28.089
- Yeah.

00:01:28.089 --> 00:01:29.567
- Because I remembered that
somebody said a long time ago

00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:30.979
that you're supposed to
get really calm and just

00:01:30.979 --> 00:01:32.696
let your body naturally float up

00:01:32.696 --> 00:01:34.925
[Beth] Oh that's good to know
-and quit fighting it. Yeah.

00:01:34.925 --> 00:01:35.758
- Yeah. I just got- I got real calm.

00:01:35.758 --> 00:01:36.690
I- I don't know if it was that

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:38.285
or if I was just like "All right."

00:01:38.285 --> 00:01:39.360
(audience laughs)

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.193
- [Max] It's been great!

00:01:40.193 --> 00:01:42.353
- This is why I ride
horses, don't do the ocean!

